4. Qg7+ Qg6 5. Qxg6+ Kxg6 6. a4) ) 1... Qxb8 2. Bxf6+ Kg3 3. d7 Qf4 { The only
way for counter-play.} 4. Bh4+ Kxh4 5. d8=B+ { Resurrection of the bishop.}  (
